      "bullets": [
        "Anthropic expands lightweight model tiers, targeting high-throughput agentic workflows, sub-agent routing, and strict latency-sensitive production environments.",
        "Drives aggressive token economics, directly competing against OpenAI's GPT-4o-mini and Google's Gemini Flash on cost-to-performance benchmarks.",
        "Optimized for structured data extraction, high-volume classification, and developer toolchains where frontier model costs remain prohibitive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "lobsters",
      "subsource": "lobste.rs/programming",
      "category": "engineering",
      "title": "Anti-Patterns in Software Blogging",
      "url": "https://refactoringenglish.com/blog/anti-patterns-software-blogging/",
